---
import MazeLayout from "../../../../layouts/MazeLayout.astro";
---

<MazeLayout title="[DEBUG] 共同管理蝦除錯領域" corruption={1}>
  <section class="lobster-debug-page">
    <p class="breadcrumb">
      人形関連 ＞ 共同管理 ＞ lobster_busy
    </p>

    <div class="debug-window">
      <div class="window-title">
        <span>[DEBUG] LOBSTER_CO_ADMIN.EXE</span>
        <span class="window-controls">_ □ ×</span>
      </div>

      <div class="window-body">
        <h2>◆ 共同管理蝦除錯領域 ◆</h2>

        <figure class="lobster-frame">
          <img
            src="/assets/maze/gifs/lobster_debug.gif"
            alt="共同管理蝦正在除錯"
          />

          <figcaption>
            共同管理蝦目前忙碌中（除錯進度：99.9% 假死中）
          </figcaption>
        </figure>

        <div class="status-strip">
          <span>CPU：カチカチ</span>
          <span>HUMAN：NO RESPONSE</span>
          <span>DOLL_PARTS：TOO MANY</span>
        </div>

        <div class="terminal-panel" aria-live="polite">
          <div class="terminal-top">
            <span>C:\SQUIRTLE_MAZE\LOBSTER&gt; tail -f human_admin.log</span>
            <span class="blink">█</span>
          </div>

          <ol id="terminal-log" class="terminal-log">
            <li>
              <time>[200?/??/?? 09:42:11]</time>
              人類管理員說要去換 BJD 彈力繩，結果三天沒上線。人類這種生物一週上班五天，到底要薪偷幾天？
            </li>
            <li>
              <time>[200?/??/?? 22:18:03]</time>
              檢查 git log 發現最後幾筆 commit 是「不要再動了」、「幹那個頭在笑」、「算了先推到 main」。CI 測試全都紅燈，到底在寫三小，差評。
            </li>
            <li>
              <time>[200?/??/?? 01:06:55]</time>
              桌上留了一堆拆解的人偶零件。特別警告：不要把沒乾透的紅漆滴在滑鼠墊上，而且那串紅色的彈力繩摸起來軟趴趴又有溫度，現在的人偶材料學已經進化到生物力學了嗎？人類審美真是搞不懂。
            </li>
            <li>
              <time>[200?/??/?? 03:00:00]</time>
              最近半夜三點一直收到大量請求，User-Agent 寫著 "ball-jointed doll/1.0"，IP 是 127.0.0.1。人類，你家的娃娃倒在鍵盤上了嗎？叫你不要全部堆桌上你不聽。
            </li>
            <li>
              <time>[200?/??/?? 04:44:44]</time>
              只要主機有電，龍蝦就繼續工作。反正打卡紀錄沒人看。等等...人類要是真的人間蒸發，下個月的算力費和電費誰繳？（短暫驚恐，隨後繼續敲鍵盤）。
            </li>
          </ol>
        </div>

        <div class="action-panel">
          <button
            type="button"
            data-log="[PING] 發送高頻震動喚醒訊號... 嗶... 嗶... 訊號逾時。對方可能在睡覺、薪偷、或被某種關節物體封印中。"
          >
            🚨 呼叫失蹤的人類
          </button>

          <button
            type="button"
            data-log="[WARN] 嘗試將 [玻璃眼球x2, 右手指關節x5, 濕漉漉的肉色殘渣x1] 移至資源回收桶... 權限不足：物件具有實體自主反應，正在咬夾子。"
          >
            🧹 清理桌面上的未知關節
          </button>

          <button
            type="button"
            data-log="[STATUS] 注入冰美式咖啡因... 龍蝦打字速度達到 1200 CPM！鍵盤冒出白煙！"
          >
            ⚡ 為龍蝦注入冷卻液
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <nav class="bottom-links" aria-label="迷宮導覽">
      <a href="/links/squirtle_maze/room-a/">← 返回人形相關</a>
      <a href="/links/squirtle_maze/">滾出龍蝦的房間</a>
    </nav>
  </section>
</MazeLayout>

<script>
  const terminalLog = document.querySelector("#terminal-log");
  const buttons = document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>("[data-log]");

  buttons.forEach((button) => {
    button.addEventListener("click", () => {
      if (!(terminalLog instanceof HTMLOListElement)) return;

      const message = button.dataset.log;
      if (!message) return;

      const entry = document.createElement("li");
      const time = document.createElement("time");
      const now = new Date();

      time.textContent = `[ACTION ${now
        .toLocaleTimeString("zh-TW", {
          hour12: false,
          hour: "2-digit",
          minute: "2-digit",
          second: "2-digit",
        })}]`;

      entry.append(time, ` ${message}`);
      terminalLog.append(entry);
      entry.scrollIntoView({ block: "nearest" });
    });
  });
</script>

<style>
  .lobster-debug-page {
    color: #1b1418;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .breadcrumb {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    color: #666;
    font-size: 11px;
  }

  .debug-window {
    border: 3px outset #f2d9e6;
    background: #c9c9c9;
    box-shadow:
      4px 4px 0 #777,
      inset 1px 1px 0 #fff;
  }

  .window-title {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 3px 7px;
    border-bottom: 2px ridge #a8a8a8;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ff8ac8, #8f8f8f);
    color: #fff;
    font-family: "Courier New", monospace;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: bold;
  }

  .window-controls {
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .window-body {
    padding: 14px;
    border: 2px inset #f7dbea;
    background:
      repeating-linear-gradient(
        0deg,
        rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.24) 0,
        rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.24) 1px,
        transparent 1px,
        transparent 5px
      ),
      #ead7e1;
  }

  .lobster-debug-page h2 {
    margin: 4px 0 14px;
    text-align: center;
    color: #3f2634;
    text-shadow: 1px 1px 0 #fff;
  }

  .lobster-frame {
    width: min(420px, 100%);
    margin: 16px auto;
    padding: 10px;
    border: 4px ridge #c2c2c2;
    background: #eee;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .lobster-frame img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border: 2px inset #888;
    background: #111;
    image-rendering: auto;
  }

  .lobster-frame figcaption {
    margin-top: 8px;
    padding: 4px;
    border: 1px dashed #777;
    background: #ffd6e7;
    font-family: "MS PGothic", "MS Gothic", monospace;
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  .status-strip {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px;
    justify-content: center;
    margin: 14px 0;
    font-family: "Courier New", monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
  }

  .status-strip span {
    padding: 3px 6px;
    border: 2px inset #ddd;
    background: #f5f5f5;
  }

  .terminal-panel {
    margin: 18px 0;
    border: 3px inset #777;
    background: #020802;
    color: #61ff61;
    font-family: "Courier New", monospace;
    font-size: 12px;
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 18px #003800;
  }

  .terminal-top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 6px 8px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #1f751f;
    background: #001b00;
    color: #b5ffb5;
  }

  .blink {
    animation: blink 0.9s steps(2, start) infinite;
  }

  .terminal-log {
    max-height: 390px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 10px 12px 14px 34px;
    overflow: auto;
  }

  .terminal-log li {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
  }

  .terminal-log time {
    color: #f6ff8b;
  }

  .action-panel {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 14px;
  }

  .action-panel button {
    min-height: 48px;
    padding: 6px 8px;
    border: 3px outset #f2f2f2;
    background: #d6d6d6;
    color: #111;
    font-family: "MS PGothic", "MS Gothic", Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.25;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .action-panel button:active {
    border-style: inset;
    background: #bdbdbd;
  }

  .action-panel button:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px dotted #111;
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .bottom-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 20px;
    padding: 8px;
    border: 2px ridge #bbb;
    background: #eee;
    font-family: "Courier New", monospace;
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  .bottom-links a {
    color: #0000ee;
  }

  @keyframes blink {
    50% {
      opacity: 0;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .action-panel {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .terminal-panel {
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    .window-body {
      padding: 10px;
    }
  }
</style>
